  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 102.62 Duly-established 100-foot buffer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 102.62 “Duly-established 100-foot buffer” means the buffer recognized in RSA 482-A:11, IV for prime wetlands designated on or after September 11, 2009 but before August 17, 2012.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100) #12801, eff 12-15-19; renumbered by #13945, (formerly Env-Wt 102.63)",
